    "updated_at": "2016-05-04T07:38:45Z",
    "body": "Per https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/5d5702d35a0b7457481d1013154f14aab25500bf this has always been broken.\n\nhttp://mxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/HashChangeEvent.webidl uses empty string instead, which seems reasonable (normal URLs would never serialize to the empty string), except that it does make several other things nullable and presumably the specification already uses null for the event object?\n",
